WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.900
<v Latha Rao>Hi Mani. Quick one today, mostly housekeeping.</v>

2
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.900
<v Mani Selvam>Morning. Yeah, no problem. What's up.</v>

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.680
<v Latha Rao>Can we move next week's session from the Tuesday to the Thursday, same time? Ravi's out Tuesday.</v>

4
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.900
<v Mani Selvam>Thursday's fine by me. Send the new invite over and I'll accept it.</v>

5
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.900
<v Latha Rao>Will do, I'll send it right after this.</v>

6
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:25.680
<v Latha Rao>Also the mockups Priya's doing slipped a day, so we'll walk through those next time instead of today.</v>

7
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.900
<v Mani Selvam>That's fine, no rush on my end this week anyway.</v>

8
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.900
<v Mani Selvam>How was the, you were at that jewellery expo thing?</v>

9
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:37.680
<v Latha Rao>Yeah, Friday. Long day on my feet but good, ran into a couple of old colleagues. Decent turnout.</v>

10
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.900
<v Mani Selvam>Nice. Right, anything you need from me before Thursday?</v>

11
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.900
<v Latha Rao>Nothing at all. Just accept the invite when it lands.</v>

12
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.900
<v Mani Selvam>Will do. Thanks Latha. Talk Thursday.</v>

13
00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.400
<v Latha Rao>Thanks Mani, bye.</v>
